# LaTeX — tailored job applications stay local (repo is public); templates are tracked
latex/CV/compact_*.tex
latex/CV/cover_letter_*.tex
!latex/CV/compact_template.tex
!latex/CV/cover_letter_template.tex

# LaTeX — loose images; the ones the .tex files use are already tracked.
# A new image a .tex file needs must be added once with `git add -f`.
latex/**/*.png
latex/**/*.jpg
latex/**/*.jpeg

